<title>RUSSIA: Aeroflot boss appoints new spokesman.</title>
<headline>Aeroflot boss appoints new spokesman.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aeroflot general director Yevgeny Shaposnikov has appointed an official from the Russian Defence ministry's press service as his spokesman and as chief of the airline's press service, the company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Alexander Luchaninov, 45, replaces Julia Maryashkina who occupied the post for a year, an Aeroflot official said.</p>
<p>-- Viktor Anoshkin, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
